@@ -37,12 +37,14 @@ its value, and what it means.
 
 ## Grouping and totals
 
+Each grouping column is its own key column, headed by its CSV column name, and
+`aggregate` returns each key value under that name.
+
 | Key | Value | Meaning |
 |---|---|---|
-| `KEY_SEPARATOR` | `" / "` | in `tabreport.aggregate`; joins the values of a multi-column key into the one key column, which is headed `group` and returned by `aggregate` under `"group"` |
 | `group order` | `key, ascending` | order of report rows unless `--sort` is given |
 | `sort descending prefix` | `-` | `--sort=-sum(amount)` puts the largest first; empty results go last |
-| `totals label` | `TOTAL` | first cell of the totals row |
+| `totals label` | `TOTAL` | first cell of the totals row; any other key cells are blank |
 | `totals` | `on` | `--no-totals` leaves the row out |
 | `mean total` | `mean of all rows` | not the mean of the group means |
 | `min and max total` | `over all rows` | smallest and largest single value |
